author: pi-agent
resolution: "Exact-pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.5, pm-changelog 2026.9.2, and pm-ops 2026.9.5. Left the changelog-date verifier unchanged because it already requires the unflagged heading to differ from the flagged one."
expected_result: "release:check and CI health --strict-exit pass against the current toolchain without weakening gates."
actual_result: "release:check components passed; coverage 220/220; changelog-date gate reports a bare ## 2026.1.2-2 control heading; health --strict-exit is 0 without gitignored nested extensions."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-05T18:17:53.424Z",pi-agent,"Pinned exact devDependencies: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.27 -> 2026.9.5, pm-changelog 2026.8.30 -> 2026.9.2, pm-ops 2026.9.2 -> 2026.9.5.\n\nNo change to scripts/verify-release-changelog-date.ts: origin/main already treats the unflagged run as a control that must differ from the flagged heading, not as a clock-derived string. Against 2026.9.2 the live gate printed:\n\nok - with the flag the heading is version-derived: ## 2026.1.2-2 - 2026-01-02\nok - the flag changes the heading: '## 2026.1.2-2 - 2026-01-02' with it, '## 2026.1.2-2' without (derived some other way)\n\nnpm run coverage: 220 pass / 0 fail. npm run changelog:check, verify:release-publish-attestation, verify:release-changelog-date, audit:prod, pack:dry-run, accept:packed all exited 0.\n\npm health --strict-exit exits 0 on a CI-shaped checkout (no gitignored .agents/pm/extensions/). Local copies of pm-csv 2026.8.16 and pm-github 2026.8.18 still resolve nested @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.21 and fail health; those paths are gitignored and are not part of this pin."
